{"4214360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead-End Bounty", "steam_appid": 4214360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214360/extras/058b7fa06e7c5c43b7d5c80dd24fce44.avif?t=1776433179\" width=488 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead-End Bounty is an open-world top-down shooter set in the wild west!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A frontier with three kinds of people: the ones on wanted posters, the ones printing them, and people like Charlie—a bounty hunter with his eyes set on one particular bounty that has slipped through his hands a few too many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns, forests, deserts, abandoned mines and every odd place in between—all open for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Than a Story Being Told</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between quests from the main story about conspiracies and enforcing justice, let yourself get sidetracked by helping (or bothering) people you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounties, Raids and the Usual Trouble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every outlaw is tied to the bigger mess going on, but they still need to be dealt with. Capture bounties for rewards, protect a town from being raided, discover secrets, and afterwards relax with a round of cards at the saloon—It sure as hell beats dragging another outlaw to jail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action Packed Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's plenty of weapons for you to buy, find, upgrade and use against the many dangers you'll come across the frontier. But don't forget; Charlie isn't afraid to use his fists. With skills to unlock that'll help you during any fight, you won't worry if you ever run out of ammo.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214360/extras/058b7fa06e7c5c43b7d5c80dd24fce44.avif?t=1776433179\" width=488 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead-End Bounty is an open-world top-down shooter set in the wild west!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A frontier with three kinds of people: the ones on wanted posters, the ones printing them, and people like Charlie—a bounty hunter with his eyes set on one particular bounty that has slipped through his hands a few too many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns, forests, deserts, abandoned mines and every odd place in between—all open for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Than a Story Being Told</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between quests from the main story about conspiracies and enforcing justice, let yourself get sidetracked by helping (or bothering) people you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounties, Raids and the Usual Trouble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every outlaw is tied to the bigger mess going on, but they still need to be dealt with. Capture bounties for rewards, protect a town from being raided, discover secrets, and afterwards relax with a round of cards at the saloon—It sure as hell beats dragging another outlaw to jail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action Packed Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's plenty of weapons for you to buy, find, upgrade and use against the many dangers you'll come across the frontier. But don't forget; Charlie isn't afraid to use his fists. With skills to unlock that'll help you during any fight, you won't worry if you ever run out of ammo.</p>", "short_description": "Dead-End Bounty is an open-world top-down shooter set in the wild west! A frontier with 3 kinds of people: the ones on wanted posters, the ones printing them, and people like Charlie—a bounty hunter with his eyes set on one particular bounty that has slipped through his hands a few too many times.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214360/1949b9281e745dc851ec0e53f4c11affc4ddfefd/header.jpg?t=1776433179", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214360/fed9589b6c06ee99152782c68f1beaf28fb44194/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776433179", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214360/fed9589b6c06ee99152782c68f1beaf28fb44194/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776433179", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-2100 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended, but not required.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 / RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended, but not required.<